snippet.description:
Sonny Cooke (Sam Nivola), a high school student, awakes from a car accident to discover his mom, Ellen (Connie Britton), looks slightly different. But no one believes him because no one else sees the change in her. He tries to navigate living with this potentially dangerous imposter while he sets out to prove he’s not crazy. 

